WEBVTT

01:28.785 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:35.465 --> 01:36.345
You again.

01:36.425 --> 01:38.385
I just wanted to greet a friend.

01:38.465 --> 01:39.985
How did you find this place?

01:40.865 --> 01:41.985
Other than the quarry,

01:42.065 --> 01:43.745
I also saw Zhong Lin change her clothes

01:43.825 --> 01:45.185
and met with His Highness's subordinates.

01:46.185 --> 01:48.665
I was bored so I asked around

01:48.745 --> 01:50.905
and deduced where both of you would be.

01:50.985 --> 01:52.345
Then, I came to pick you up.

01:59.425 --> 02:02.705
I saw you both come out
of His Highness's manor

02:02.785 --> 02:05.625
whilst disguised as tattoo artists.

02:05.705 --> 02:07.585
You also mentioned forging just now.

02:07.665 --> 02:10.425
So, I ran it through my mind

02:10.505 --> 02:12.465
to see what exactly

02:12.545 --> 02:17.705
you need forged in
Prince of Yuzhang's Manor.

02:20.665 --> 02:23.225
Well,
if you wish to forge His Highness's seal,

02:23.825 --> 02:25.305
allow me to suggest

02:25.385 --> 02:27.465
Wuxi green jade.

02:28.825 --> 02:30.625
Miss Ling, Wuxi green jade

02:30.705 --> 02:32.625
is indeed the material with
which the royal seal is made.

02:35.545 --> 02:37.025
I keep running into you.

02:37.105 --> 02:37.985
What are you after?

02:38.065 --> 02:40.265
I wish to follow you and achieve greatness

02:40.345 --> 02:42.065
to make a name for myself

02:42.145 --> 02:43.065
in this martial world.

02:43.145 --> 02:46.105
Fame and glory are but an illusion.
I do not share your goal.

02:46.185 --> 02:47.345
We all have different ambitions.

02:47.425 --> 02:48.625
But isn't it beautiful

02:48.705 --> 02:50.065
to share a journey together?

03:03.665 --> 03:05.505
Wuxi green jade
for your perusal, Your Majesty.

03:10.465 --> 03:11.745
Good.

03:19.265 --> 03:20.305
Why are you shaking?

03:21.905 --> 03:22.985
I'm not killing you.

03:23.785 --> 03:25.025
Thank you for clemency, Your Highness.

03:25.625 --> 03:26.865
Have you found

03:27.425 --> 03:28.905
the two fraudsters?

03:30.265 --> 03:31.145
Your Highness,

03:31.225 --> 03:34.385
they snuck out of the manor stealthily
and disappeared.

03:34.465 --> 03:36.385
But none of our property is lost.

03:36.985 --> 03:38.985
And you couldn't discern
real tattoo artists from the fake ones?

03:40.385 --> 03:42.305
Tattoos have intricate patterns.

03:42.385 --> 03:44.545
But those fraudsters did a good job
replicating the patterns.

03:44.625 --> 03:46.505
So you're saying

03:47.265 --> 03:49.545
that they put in so much effort

03:49.625 --> 03:52.025
into approaching me

03:52.105 --> 03:54.625
so that they could tattoo a bird on me

03:54.705 --> 03:56.265
to humiliate me?

03:57.225 --> 03:59.065
You're an idiot!

04:01.505 --> 04:02.785
You know what?

04:02.865 --> 04:05.225
Re-enact the whole
scene with the housekeeper.

04:05.905 --> 04:08.305
Even if you can't figure out the truth,

04:08.385 --> 04:09.825
I will still spare you.

04:10.745 --> 04:11.945
Thank you, Your Highness.

04:12.025 --> 04:13.265
But I'll break your legs

04:13.345 --> 04:15.145
and feed you to the hounds.

04:18.345 --> 04:19.624
Make haste.

04:20.585 --> 04:21.585
Yes.

04:26.705 --> 04:29.665
FENGLAI PAVILION

04:31.785 --> 04:33.985
Forgive me. All jades are unique.

04:34.585 --> 04:37.625
This one might be slightly different
from the one used by Prince of Yuzhang.

04:37.705 --> 04:39.385
-It can't be helped.
-This jade

04:39.465 --> 04:41.025
is more polished than the real one.

04:41.105 --> 04:42.545
And you found it within one night?

04:42.625 --> 04:43.705
You're amazing.

04:46.185 --> 04:47.225
Prince of Yuzhang's seal

04:47.305 --> 04:50.065
is engraved
with four claws that subdue evil.

04:50.145 --> 04:51.185
Just who exactly are you?

04:52.505 --> 04:54.545
I'm Bai Chifan

04:54.625 --> 04:55.665
of the Xiling region.

04:55.745 --> 04:56.905
Bai Chifan?

04:57.825 --> 04:58.985
Bai Chifan.

04:59.985 --> 05:02.545
You have the name of a fraudster.

05:02.625 --> 05:03.825
You are mistaken.

05:03.905 --> 05:05.425
I come

05:05.505 --> 05:07.265
from an affluent family,

05:07.345 --> 05:08.585
so I must be discreet.

05:10.025 --> 05:11.745
Are you related to the Bai clan of Xiling?

05:13.065 --> 05:14.265
A distant relative of theirs.

05:14.345 --> 05:15.385
A distant relative?

05:15.465 --> 05:17.905
The Bai clan of Xiling
is a sword-wielding clan.

05:18.505 --> 05:20.865
They were a big name
in the martial world for several decades.

05:20.945 --> 05:22.945
Then, they went to
the western regions to trade.

05:23.025 --> 05:25.265
It is true that they are rich right now.

05:26.985 --> 05:29.505
-So you truly are Bai Chifan?
-Yes.

05:29.585 --> 05:32.385
A spoiled heir who forsook
martial arts for mercantile skills?

05:32.465 --> 05:35.025
Who's your father?
My origin doesn't define me.

05:35.105 --> 05:37.185
Just like I never asked
who your father is.

05:37.785 --> 05:38.905
Why must you know who my father is?

05:41.345 --> 05:42.985
So you're just a spoiled heir.

05:43.065 --> 05:44.705
Do you even know
what makes the martial world?

05:46.225 --> 05:48.105
Everyone has a different take.

05:48.625 --> 05:49.505
Some fight for vengeance.

05:49.585 --> 05:50.625
Some fight for justice

05:50.705 --> 05:51.985
or bonds that cannot be severed.

05:52.585 --> 05:53.465
They all make up the martial world.

05:53.545 --> 05:55.105
In my opinion,

05:55.185 --> 05:58.105
it is enough as long as I possess the will

05:58.185 --> 05:59.225
to wield my sword.

06:01.505 --> 06:02.905
Since you're so insightful,

06:02.985 --> 06:04.625
can you guess

06:04.705 --> 06:07.545
what I'm after?

06:10.985 --> 06:12.625
Expensive robes. Thumb ring.

06:13.305 --> 06:14.265
Royal seal.

06:14.785 --> 06:16.065
Are you gathering these items

06:16.745 --> 06:18.785
to impersonate Prince of Yuzhang?

06:20.025 --> 06:21.905
It's not that serious.
You'll just get your entire family killed.

06:23.145 --> 06:25.105
Oh. From what I was told,

06:25.185 --> 06:27.985
Prince of Yuzhang might seem boisterous,

06:28.065 --> 06:29.425
but he's actually quite observant.

06:29.505 --> 06:32.145
He might
have already seen through your trick.

06:40.585 --> 06:44.025
It seems like I did underestimate you.

06:44.545 --> 06:46.065
I hope you won't bar me

06:46.145 --> 06:47.785
from joining Fenglai Pavilion

06:47.865 --> 06:49.385
simply because I know too much.

06:49.465 --> 06:50.625
Of course, not.

06:51.465 --> 06:54.265
Fenglai Pavilion
never breaks its promises.

06:54.905 --> 06:56.425
My friend, take a seat.

06:57.145 --> 06:59.985
Don't worry.
We do not renege on our promises.

07:00.065 --> 07:01.865
Give me a few days.

07:01.945 --> 07:03.585
After I consult the rest,

07:03.665 --> 07:05.865
I'll give you a satisfactory answer.

07:19.505 --> 07:22.705
Miss Ling, you're committing a crime.

07:22.785 --> 07:25.305
It's against our sect's rules.

07:25.985 --> 07:27.745
He knows too much.

07:27.825 --> 07:30.105
I can't risk letting him ruin our plan.

07:30.185 --> 07:31.665
Luo, imprison him.

07:31.745 --> 07:33.665
-Yes.
-Zhong Lin.

07:33.745 --> 07:35.945
Check if someone did
leave the Bai clan of Xiling

07:36.025 --> 07:38.345
to go on an adventure
in the martial world.

07:38.425 --> 07:39.505
Yes.

07:45.305 --> 07:49.745
FENGLAI PAVILION

08:05.185 --> 08:06.825
They know Cangcang
is after Frostflame Iron.

08:06.905 --> 08:08.225
Something's afoot.

08:08.305 --> 08:09.545
Report back to the capital immediately.

08:25.265 --> 08:26.785
We get in from this side

08:26.865 --> 08:28.265
and you will enter from here.

08:28.345 --> 08:29.185
REFINEMENT QUARRY

08:29.265 --> 08:30.305
We'll group up here.

08:31.025 --> 08:33.144
Once it's done, wait for my signal.

08:34.945 --> 08:37.465
-Cangcang.I need to tell you something.
-Oh, you're here.

08:37.545 --> 08:40.185
Luo. Look. The royal seal is done.

08:40.264 --> 08:42.385
Everything is in order.
It's up to you now.

08:44.465 --> 08:47.145
Cangcang. I have to be away for a while.

08:49.665 --> 08:50.905
Are you serious?

08:51.545 --> 08:53.265
-I'm serious.
-You are?

08:55.865 --> 08:56.705
But

08:56.785 --> 08:57.865
we planned this for so long.

08:57.945 --> 08:59.265
If you leave now,
everything will go to waste.

09:00.425 --> 09:03.305
Besides, how am I supposed
to find another Prince of Yuzhang?

09:03.905 --> 09:05.905
Why don't we delay it for a few days?

09:05.985 --> 09:06.945
No.

09:07.465 --> 09:09.345
If we miss the timing, we'll be in danger.

09:10.905 --> 09:13.265
It is an urgent matter
that I must attend to.

09:15.505 --> 09:16.585
Is it my father?

09:21.065 --> 09:22.425
The worst outcome will always happen.

09:24.225 --> 09:26.025
Why must he take
you away at this crucial moment?

09:26.705 --> 09:27.625
Just go.

09:28.225 --> 09:30.385
-What will you do now?
-What can I do? I'll figure it out.

09:39.745 --> 09:40.625
He left for real.

09:41.705 --> 09:42.745
I…

09:43.745 --> 09:44.745
Cangcang.

09:44.825 --> 09:46.505
He left just like that.
Who can impersonate Prince of Yuzhang now?

09:46.585 --> 09:47.825
How would I know?

09:58.425 --> 09:59.465
Perhaps…

10:05.705 --> 10:07.185
Miss Ling.

10:07.265 --> 10:08.785
How have you been?

10:13.625 --> 10:14.465
What do you think, Cangcang?

10:17.225 --> 10:18.225
It's not good.

10:18.825 --> 10:19.825
What do you mean?

10:19.905 --> 10:21.745
I have the thumb ring and the fan.

10:22.585 --> 10:23.985
No, it's not good.

10:24.065 --> 10:25.905
You look like a feeble scholar,

10:25.985 --> 10:27.345
and not a prince.

10:27.905 --> 10:28.865
What do we do now then?

10:29.465 --> 10:31.705
Are we just going to give up?

10:35.745 --> 10:36.705
This is bad.

10:38.105 --> 10:39.185
What should we do?

10:44.305 --> 10:46.305
I have an idea.

11:02.345 --> 11:03.705
I was careless.

11:31.505 --> 11:33.545
Miss Ling, what is the meaning of this?

11:33.625 --> 11:35.145
Speak! Who exactly are you?

11:35.705 --> 11:37.585
-Bai Chifan.
-Stubborn, aren't you?

11:38.625 --> 11:39.825
Bring them in.

11:45.585 --> 11:48.345
Fenglai Pavilion
has a wide selection of torture tools.

12:01.745 --> 12:03.865
I'm giving you one last chance.

12:03.945 --> 12:05.145
Answer honestly.

12:05.865 --> 12:06.905
If you lie to me,

12:06.985 --> 12:09.105
you'll have a taste
of all my torture devices.

12:09.665 --> 12:10.665
Ask away.

12:13.065 --> 12:15.865
Did my father send you here to spy on me?

12:15.945 --> 12:17.105
No one

12:17.185 --> 12:18.745
can order me around.

12:19.345 --> 12:21.865
You can be the first if you let me

12:21.945 --> 12:23.265
join Fenglai Pavilion.

12:24.865 --> 12:26.425
How arrogant.

12:26.985 --> 12:27.825
Who are you? The emperor?

12:28.665 --> 12:30.225
If my father did not send you here,

12:30.305 --> 12:33.025
why do you know and care about

12:33.105 --> 12:34.865
my whereabouts and Fenglai Pavilion?

12:34.945 --> 12:35.785
Explain yourself.

12:35.865 --> 12:37.065
One who understands
the rules of the five elements

12:37.145 --> 12:39.225
and the nature of humanity

12:39.305 --> 12:40.785
will know all there is
to know in the universe.

12:52.025 --> 12:53.185
Enough of your nonsense.

12:53.985 --> 12:56.145
I am not making anything up.

12:56.225 --> 12:57.625
My father did not send you here?

12:57.705 --> 12:59.825
Shouldn't I be more trustworthy

13:00.345 --> 13:02.265
if I were close to your father?

13:11.025 --> 13:12.185
Release him.

13:25.305 --> 13:26.945
He has the looks

13:27.825 --> 13:30.105
and the comportment for it.

13:31.185 --> 13:32.705
Since I have no better option,

13:32.785 --> 13:34.025
I'll just have to use him.

13:34.905 --> 13:35.945
Bai Chifan.

13:37.425 --> 13:38.305
I have a use for you.

13:43.145 --> 13:44.745
FENGLAI PAVILION

13:44.825 --> 13:46.625
Miss Ling, can you tell me

13:46.705 --> 13:48.745
why I must impersonate Prince of Yuzhang

13:48.825 --> 13:50.945
and risk getting my entire family killed?

13:51.865 --> 13:54.385
Don't worry.
Now that you're part of my sect,

13:55.505 --> 13:57.185
you're mine.

13:58.025 --> 13:59.665
Come what may,

13:59.745 --> 14:01.305
I'll protect you.

14:02.745 --> 14:05.745
And if I insist on finding out why?

14:07.905 --> 14:08.985
Right.

14:09.065 --> 14:11.065
Since you're taking the risk,

14:11.145 --> 14:13.265
you earn the right to know.

14:17.065 --> 14:17.905
Give me a moment.

14:26.385 --> 14:28.145
FROSTFLAME IRON

14:28.905 --> 14:30.825
Frostflame Iron?

14:30.905 --> 14:32.425
Yes. Did you know?

14:32.505 --> 14:33.905
One who owns Frostflame Iron

14:33.985 --> 14:36.345
can craft a divine
weapon to lead the martial world.

14:37.185 --> 14:38.105
Frostflame Iron

14:38.185 --> 14:41.225
must first endure
abyssal flame for a millennium

14:41.305 --> 14:43.705
before being frozen for another millennium

14:43.785 --> 14:46.625
in order to form this distinct pattern.

14:46.705 --> 14:47.865
Also,

14:47.945 --> 14:50.305
a sword made of this iron

14:50.385 --> 14:51.665
is indestructible.

14:52.705 --> 14:54.025
The Great Qi Dynasty has not seen

14:54.105 --> 14:55.745
such material in several centuries.

14:55.825 --> 14:57.185
Several days ago,

14:57.265 --> 14:59.625
they found one
in the quarry in Southern Chu.

14:59.705 --> 15:02.585
So you want me to
impersonate Prince of Yuzhang

15:02.665 --> 15:04.665
to get this iron ore?

15:04.745 --> 15:07.545
Yes. Prince of Yuzhang rules Southern Chu.

15:07.625 --> 15:08.745
If Prince of Yuzhang wants it,

15:08.825 --> 15:09.985
they'll have to turn it in.

15:10.585 --> 15:11.665
You're so naive.

15:11.745 --> 15:14.825
Do you really think a few weapons
with this iron will allow you

15:14.905 --> 15:15.825
to rule the martial world?

15:15.905 --> 15:16.745
What's wrong with that?

15:16.825 --> 15:18.185
In this martial world,

15:18.265 --> 15:19.625
the sharper the blade,
the more power you have.

15:19.705 --> 15:21.505
What else?

15:25.825 --> 15:27.385
BRUSH AND INK

15:27.465 --> 15:30.105
Father, I am telling the truth.

15:33.865 --> 15:35.425
In that case, explain why

15:35.505 --> 15:38.145
Cangcang put in so much effort

15:38.225 --> 15:41.145
for one Frostflame Iron.

15:41.225 --> 15:42.745
She was looking for the hall master

15:42.825 --> 15:44.625
and wanted someone to
impersonate Prince of Yuzhang.

15:45.145 --> 15:46.905
If she wanted the iron ore,

15:46.985 --> 15:48.425
she could've come to me.

15:49.265 --> 15:50.585
Perhaps Young Lady

15:50.665 --> 15:51.785
doesn't want to rely
on you for everything.

15:53.425 --> 15:54.425
It's not as simple as that.

15:55.385 --> 15:58.145
Cangcang has always
been an opinionated kid.

16:03.025 --> 16:04.105
Xianxue.

16:05.025 --> 16:06.705
I know

16:06.785 --> 16:08.585
you are loyal, responsible,

16:09.305 --> 16:10.305
and meticulous.

16:11.745 --> 16:14.785
But you seem to forget to mention

16:15.385 --> 16:16.705
a certain Bai clan member of Xiling

16:17.785 --> 16:19.545
who approached Cangcang lately.

16:21.425 --> 16:22.345
He…

16:23.505 --> 16:24.545
He's Bai Chifan.

16:25.305 --> 16:26.465
He keeps pestering Young Lady.

16:27.065 --> 16:29.505
But she doesn't really take him seriously.

16:30.145 --> 16:31.985
She even thought
you had sent him to spy on her.

16:32.065 --> 16:34.345
Do you know why I summoned you

16:35.225 --> 16:36.825
back here?

16:36.905 --> 16:37.905
Please enlighten me.

16:47.705 --> 16:49.145
Xianxue.

16:50.105 --> 16:51.825
You must know

16:51.905 --> 16:53.585
that Cangcang

16:54.105 --> 16:56.265
is now in Southern Chu,

16:56.345 --> 16:58.465
the territory of Prince of Yuzhang.

17:02.225 --> 17:03.465
Xianxue.

17:05.745 --> 17:07.464
No matter what happens,

17:08.785 --> 17:11.065
you must protect her.

17:11.905 --> 17:13.145
In the meantime,

17:13.224 --> 17:14.825
I need to know

17:15.785 --> 17:17.025
what she's doing.

17:17.944 --> 17:19.224
Yes, Father.

17:19.825 --> 17:22.145
Now return to Southern Chu.

17:22.665 --> 17:25.145
I need you to do something.

17:30.705 --> 17:32.745
-Yes, Sir.
-Go now.

17:35.785 --> 17:36.665
Xianxue.

17:38.385 --> 17:39.745
You must know that Cangcang

17:41.545 --> 17:43.145
will be the Empress consort.

17:47.665 --> 17:50.185
So cease whatever wishful thinking

17:51.105 --> 17:52.545
you have now.

17:55.825 --> 17:56.745
Yes.

18:02.585 --> 18:04.105
Let's go.

18:04.185 --> 18:06.145
People have gone missing lately.

18:06.225 --> 18:07.585
Let's hurry up.

18:08.465 --> 18:10.825
We've been foraging
for vegetables in the mountains.

18:10.905 --> 18:12.825
I'm so hungry that I can't walk.

18:16.305 --> 18:17.265
A bun!

18:18.465 --> 18:20.225
Don't eat it.
We don't know where it's from.

18:20.305 --> 18:21.385
What if it's poisoned?

18:21.465 --> 18:23.785
Why would anyone poison a bun?

18:34.625 --> 18:35.745
Wake up!

18:37.105 --> 18:38.265
Get up!

18:39.545 --> 18:40.665
Get up!

18:47.425 --> 18:48.625
Eat the buns now

18:49.225 --> 18:50.705
or you won't even be able to afford it

18:50.785 --> 18:52.385
in the quarry.

19:32.145 --> 19:34.105
Greetings, Your Majesty.

19:34.185 --> 19:35.545
Why are you

19:35.625 --> 19:37.105
sneaking up this late at night?

19:37.185 --> 19:38.705
It is my duty to make sure

19:38.785 --> 19:40.545
that you are always alert, Your Majesty.

19:41.865 --> 19:43.385
All right, Shi Yan. Take a seat.

19:54.305 --> 19:56.265
Shi Yan. Did you find anything

19:56.345 --> 19:57.985
about Refinement Quarry
that I told you to?

19:58.545 --> 20:00.185
Your Majesty, on the surface,

20:00.265 --> 20:02.345
that quarry mines and processes ores.

20:02.425 --> 20:03.905
But in reality, it runs a monopoly

20:03.985 --> 20:06.505
that abducts citizens to be miners
and forges weapons without authorization.

20:06.585 --> 20:07.745
Many people have died.

20:09.025 --> 20:10.945
Many young boys went
missing in Southern Chu.

20:11.025 --> 20:11.985
In fact, more than 100
young boys have disappeared.

20:12.585 --> 20:14.025
Southern Chu is an affluent region

20:14.105 --> 20:15.145
that is governed by Prince of Yuzhang.

20:15.225 --> 20:16.865
You must have misheard, Your Majesty.

20:18.265 --> 20:21.385
In that case,
they are behind the missing boys

20:21.465 --> 20:22.385
of Southern Chu.

20:22.905 --> 20:24.465
At this moment, it seems so.

20:24.545 --> 20:25.745
My investigation

20:25.825 --> 20:27.545
reveals that Lingbi Sect
is behind the quarry.

20:27.625 --> 20:28.985
And the one running the sect is…

20:29.065 --> 20:31.105
Grand Tutor Ling is quite ambitious.

20:31.185 --> 20:33.625
Southern Chu is
Prince of Yuzhang's territory,

20:33.705 --> 20:35.945
and he is committing his crime here.

20:36.025 --> 20:38.985
Isn't Ling Cangcang
sabotaging her father's plan

20:39.065 --> 20:40.585
by going to the quarry?

20:41.905 --> 20:43.825
Perhaps she isn't even aware

20:43.905 --> 20:45.745
of the ties between
her father and Lingbi Sect.

20:48.785 --> 20:50.585
Luo Xianxue
returned to the capital suddenly.

20:51.145 --> 20:52.745
He might already know that I'm here.

20:52.825 --> 20:54.665
This time, not only must
we bring back the Empress,

20:54.745 --> 20:56.505
we must also get rid of Lingbi Sect,

20:57.505 --> 20:58.905
thereby extinguishing
his contingency plan.

20:58.985 --> 21:01.585
The marriage is inevitable.

21:01.665 --> 21:04.625
We must now help Ling Cangcang
achieve her goal as soon as possible.

21:10.545 --> 21:12.785
Impersonating me in public?

21:12.865 --> 21:13.985
The audacity of it!

21:14.665 --> 21:16.505
Slow down. They can't have run far.

21:16.585 --> 21:18.385
Are you sure
they headed to Refinement Quarry?

21:18.465 --> 21:20.425
Yes. Absolutely.

21:21.305 --> 21:22.425
All right.

21:23.025 --> 21:25.985
If you make another wrong judgment,
you'll pay for it.

21:36.985 --> 21:38.825
Hurry up! Faster!

21:40.065 --> 21:42.185
I'm talking about you! Hurry!

21:42.265 --> 21:44.505
There are only kids in this cave.

21:44.585 --> 21:45.865
No need to feed them properly.

21:45.945 --> 21:47.465
Just one bun per day.

21:48.065 --> 21:49.025
If that's not enough,

21:49.105 --> 21:50.065
tell them to drink water.

21:50.665 --> 21:53.825
Sir, the laborers we have
are too swollen to walk now.

21:53.905 --> 21:55.625
Ten kids died last month.

21:55.705 --> 21:58.065
All our men are out there capturing kids.

21:58.145 --> 22:00.105
But we still don't have enough manpower.

22:00.185 --> 22:02.585
There is even a rumor saying

22:02.665 --> 22:04.345
that the ghosts are kidnapping kids.

22:04.425 --> 22:05.265
Besides,

22:05.345 --> 22:07.065
if something bad happens,

22:07.145 --> 22:08.225
what do we do?

22:08.305 --> 22:10.105
We are working
for the Ghost King after all!

22:10.185 --> 22:11.305
Right.

22:12.185 --> 22:13.545
He wants the money urgently.

22:13.625 --> 22:15.185
What can we do?

22:15.785 --> 22:18.705
And you. You talk a lot

22:18.785 --> 22:19.825
and eat a lot.

22:22.305 --> 22:23.225
What now?

22:23.305 --> 22:24.465
Why are you in a rush?

22:24.545 --> 22:25.905
Prince of Yuzhang is here.

22:26.785 --> 22:27.705
Prince of Yuzhang?

22:29.465 --> 22:30.505
What is he doing here?

23:07.305 --> 23:08.945
Greetings, Your…

23:27.465 --> 23:28.785
Are you the owner of this quarry?

23:30.385 --> 23:31.545
Greetings, Your Highness.

23:31.625 --> 23:34.185
What can I do for you?

23:36.185 --> 23:37.425
I was told

23:37.505 --> 23:38.985
that you found Frostflame Iron.

23:42.665 --> 23:44.425
Your Highness, you need not come here

23:44.505 --> 23:45.665
in person for one iron ore.

23:46.585 --> 23:47.785
If you desire it,

23:47.865 --> 23:48.705
just say so

23:48.785 --> 23:50.905
and I will have
it delivered to your manor.

23:58.425 --> 23:59.345
What?

24:00.105 --> 24:01.625
Are you doubting my identity?

24:03.905 --> 24:04.825
Of course, not.

24:11.385 --> 24:12.505
Look closely.

24:15.785 --> 24:18.185
Wuxi green jade.
Even a fortune can't buy it.

24:18.785 --> 24:19.625
It is in the right form too.

24:24.825 --> 24:25.825
Frostflame Iron, is it?

24:26.425 --> 24:27.425
Let me retrieve it now.

24:29.185 --> 24:30.345
You, come with me.

24:30.425 --> 24:32.865
-You two, serve His Highness tea.
-Yes.

25:09.585 --> 25:11.265
What a delicate chest.

25:11.345 --> 25:13.585
It must have been
made by a famous blacksmith.

25:15.345 --> 25:16.625
You know many things, Your Highness.

25:16.705 --> 25:19.425
Precious iron ores must
be stored in a precious box.

25:19.505 --> 25:20.705
Please, Your Highness.

26:00.985 --> 26:02.945
How dare you
try to murder Prince of Yuzhang!

26:03.025 --> 26:04.265
Prince of Yuzhang?

26:05.305 --> 26:06.305
The prince's royal seal

26:06.385 --> 26:07.745
has four claws to subdue evil.

26:07.825 --> 26:09.345
But yours has five claws.

26:12.185 --> 26:14.225
Prince of Yuzhang's seal is engraved

26:14.305 --> 26:15.545
with four claws to subdue evil.

26:17.265 --> 26:19.225
If I don't even
possess such basic knowledge,

26:19.305 --> 26:21.545
how can I even run my smithing business?

26:21.625 --> 26:22.745
Insolence!

26:36.825 --> 26:37.985
Hold your breath.

28:07.505 --> 28:08.665
Give chase now! Quick!

28:10.225 --> 28:11.305
Hurry!

28:14.425 --> 28:15.665
Over there!

28:22.265 --> 28:23.265
You can escape no more.

28:23.345 --> 28:25.425
Don't you know where you are?

28:25.505 --> 28:27.985
You think you
can steal the Frostflame Iron?

28:29.105 --> 28:30.145
Who says

28:31.745 --> 28:33.785
we're after the Frostflame Iron?

28:45.665 --> 28:47.945
Mister, you are…

28:48.945 --> 28:51.105
I am Shi Yan. Mr. Bai Chifan asked me

28:51.185 --> 28:52.465
to assist Fenglai Pavilion.

28:53.105 --> 28:54.145
Bai Chifan…

29:04.225 --> 29:05.305
What is going on?

29:05.385 --> 29:07.145
I think Quarry No. 2 blew up.

29:11.505 --> 29:12.865
Sir, this is bad!

29:12.945 --> 29:15.105
Sir! The slaves…

29:15.185 --> 29:17.185
-The slaves escaped.
-What?

29:18.785 --> 29:22.105
But sir, you said someone
was impersonating Prince of Yuzhang.

29:22.185 --> 29:24.065
So I dispatched all our men here.

29:27.465 --> 29:29.745
You fled on purpose

29:29.825 --> 29:30.745
to lure us here?

29:32.345 --> 29:34.745
It seems like
I've underestimated you both.

29:35.345 --> 29:36.345
I'm glad you know that.

29:37.145 --> 29:38.185
Bai Chifan.

29:38.265 --> 29:39.745
Zhong Lin already rescued those kids.

29:39.825 --> 29:40.985
Find an opening and flee.

29:41.585 --> 29:43.105
I'll watch your back.

29:45.665 --> 29:47.985
No, allow me to protect you.

29:53.785 --> 29:57.105
What a tear-jerking pair
of star-crossed lovers.

29:57.185 --> 29:59.585
Unfortunately for you,
my smoke is laced with potent poison.

30:00.265 --> 30:01.345
It won't be long till you fall.

30:05.705 --> 30:06.545
Surrender

30:07.425 --> 30:09.825
yourself now and come clean.

30:10.425 --> 30:12.545
Then perhaps I'll spare you.

30:18.825 --> 30:19.825
Kill them all!

30:50.065 --> 30:52.105
Leave none alive. Kill them all!

31:03.785 --> 31:05.305
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

31:06.585 --> 31:07.625
Charge!

31:48.905 --> 31:49.945
Run now.

31:50.905 --> 31:51.865
Come!

32:11.265 --> 32:13.265
Don't worry about me. Just go.

32:35.305 --> 32:36.265
Come.

32:37.505 --> 32:38.705
Take this.

32:55.625 --> 32:56.785
What is it?

32:57.865 --> 32:58.745
A pill to save you.

33:36.545 --> 33:38.185
You don't want to
leave any witnesses alive.

35:35.905 --> 35:36.865
Ghost King of the Lingbi Sect?

36:13.625 --> 36:14.905
What a monster reared by Lingbi Sect.

36:16.225 --> 36:17.305
He is invincible.

36:37.825 --> 36:39.625
Prince of Yuzhang? He's finally here.

36:40.225 --> 36:41.105
Quite late too.

36:52.265 --> 36:54.985
Your Highness, please capture
these unscrupulous scoundrels.

36:55.585 --> 36:57.425
It's you, my dear brother.

36:57.945 --> 37:00.905
You're the unscrupulous scoundrels.

37:00.985 --> 37:02.025
Subdue them!

37:02.105 --> 37:03.705
-Yes, Your Highness.
-It's not us.

37:04.705 --> 37:06.665
You're mistaken.
We did this because we wanted to rescue…

37:11.025 --> 37:11.905
Let go of me.

37:15.065 --> 37:16.025
Let go!

37:22.625 --> 37:24.105
This is just a misunderstanding.

37:24.185 --> 37:26.345
We did this because
we wanted to rescue the slaves.

37:26.425 --> 37:28.825
Let me talk to His Highness! Don't go!

37:33.145 --> 37:33.985
I'm sorry.

37:35.705 --> 37:37.305
I promised to protect you.

37:37.985 --> 37:39.145
I failed that.

37:39.225 --> 37:41.425
But who knew Prince of
Yuzhang would arrive this late?

37:41.985 --> 37:43.585
So you wanted to
impersonate Prince of Yuzhang

37:43.665 --> 37:44.785
to lure the culprits away

37:44.865 --> 37:47.105
before you could bring them to justice?

37:47.945 --> 37:50.345
The miners were abducted off the street.

37:50.425 --> 37:52.825
Many of them are just teenagers.

37:53.545 --> 37:55.665
Fenglai Pavilion
doesn't covet fame and glory.

37:55.745 --> 37:57.305
We just want to help the helpless ones.

37:58.145 --> 38:01.185
So that's why
she refuses to enter the palace.

38:06.025 --> 38:08.745
If the plan fails, you might die.

38:08.825 --> 38:10.065
Have you thought about that?

38:10.905 --> 38:13.065
My life is precious, but so are theirs.

38:17.065 --> 38:18.945
I used you as bait today.

38:19.465 --> 38:20.385
I'm sorry.

38:20.465 --> 38:22.425
But it wasn't my
intention to get you hurt.

38:24.225 --> 38:25.345
Show me your wound.

38:27.025 --> 38:28.345
It's nothing.

38:28.425 --> 38:29.665
But you…

38:34.985 --> 38:36.945
In this vast world,
it's hard to find someone

38:37.025 --> 38:37.985
who will defend those victims.

38:39.025 --> 38:40.425
If this is your goal,

38:40.945 --> 38:42.105
I'll do everything I can

38:42.185 --> 38:43.345
to make sure you're not alone in this.

38:50.385 --> 38:53.905
Speaking of which,
he has saved me several times.

38:56.665 --> 38:58.265
No, allow me to protect you.

39:11.945 --> 39:14.745
Your pulse is stable but weak.

39:21.225 --> 39:22.545
It's all thanks to your pill.

39:23.105 --> 39:24.025
It sped up the recovery.

39:26.865 --> 39:28.705
How come you are immune

39:28.785 --> 39:30.145
to the poisonous smoke?

39:30.745 --> 39:32.865
Besides, you were shot by an arrow too.

39:34.745 --> 39:37.065
I am immune to all poisons.

39:40.545 --> 39:41.825
It's fine if you don't want to tell me.

39:43.905 --> 39:45.065
I'm serious.

39:45.905 --> 39:47.225
I'll tell you more in the future.

40:02.385 --> 40:03.585
Your Highness.

40:03.665 --> 40:04.585
A missive from the Empress Dowager.

40:11.185 --> 40:13.305
Your Highness! What if Her Highness wishes

40:13.385 --> 40:14.705
to tell you something important?

40:15.305 --> 40:16.865
Every time Mother wrote to me,

40:16.945 --> 40:18.785
it was about His Majesty.

40:18.865 --> 40:20.145
I know what I'm doing.

40:23.665 --> 40:25.905
I'm leaving now.
Are you not going to see me off?

40:25.985 --> 40:27.385
From now on,

40:27.465 --> 40:29.105
you're a prince who governs a region.

40:29.185 --> 40:31.305
You'll have to think before you act now.

40:31.385 --> 40:33.625
Huan, before I leave, can you please

40:33.705 --> 40:35.745
give me the Great Qi Divination Chart

40:36.345 --> 40:37.425
drawn by Father?

40:37.505 --> 40:38.985
Father left it behind,

40:39.065 --> 40:39.945
and I wish to keep it

40:40.545 --> 40:41.385
as memorabilia.

40:43.185 --> 40:45.105
Father's chart

40:45.185 --> 40:47.145
contains the topography

40:47.225 --> 40:48.865
of Great Qi.

40:48.945 --> 40:50.265
You're asking for this chart.

40:50.345 --> 40:51.745
Does this mean you are still

40:52.385 --> 40:53.745
coveting the throne?

40:56.025 --> 40:57.025
Remember now.

40:58.065 --> 40:59.465
As long as I breathe,

41:00.385 --> 41:01.705
you will not

41:01.785 --> 41:03.185
have the divination chart.

41:30.705 --> 41:32.705
Prince of Yuzhang? You're finally here.

41:32.785 --> 41:34.225
I did impersonate and deceive you.

41:34.305 --> 41:35.625
But it was to save the kids.

41:35.705 --> 41:37.625
My achievement can offset the crime.

41:38.225 --> 41:39.545
No, it cannot.

41:39.625 --> 41:41.185
Can you be a generous soul
and let it slide?

41:41.785 --> 41:44.145
I hate the word,

41:44.225 --> 41:46.825
generous, the most.

41:46.905 --> 41:49.785
When I see that bird on my back,

41:54.785 --> 41:57.905
it only fuels my hatred more.

41:58.425 --> 41:59.665
Unless…

42:01.225 --> 42:02.065
Unless what?

42:02.145 --> 42:03.825
Unless the man behind you

42:03.905 --> 42:06.105
can apologize to me properly,

42:07.185 --> 42:09.185
then I may consider forgiving your crime.

42:09.825 --> 42:10.865
Look.

42:10.945 --> 42:12.545
I coerced him into coming here.

42:12.625 --> 42:13.625
It has nothing to do with him.

42:13.705 --> 42:14.905
I'll apologize to you on his behalf.

42:19.625 --> 42:20.905
I am Bai Chifan.

42:20.985 --> 42:21.945
It was not my intention to offend you.

42:22.025 --> 42:23.665
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

42:32.145 --> 42:33.145
Mr. Bai,

42:33.225 --> 42:35.545
you can put your dignity aside
when need be.

42:37.225 --> 42:39.545
Are you Bai Chifan for real?

42:43.065 --> 42:44.225
Yes.

42:44.825 --> 42:46.505
If that's the case,

42:46.585 --> 42:48.225
do you know the consequences

42:48.305 --> 42:49.705
of impersonating me?

42:50.425 --> 42:51.945
Wait, Your Highness.

42:52.025 --> 42:52.985
You are the ruler of Southern Chu

42:53.065 --> 42:55.585
yet you did not know
that there was an illegal quarry

42:55.665 --> 42:57.145
that refined iron in your feudal land.

42:57.945 --> 42:59.505
If His Majesty learns of it,

43:00.305 --> 43:01.745
you will be beheaded.

43:05.265 --> 43:07.825
We found the culprit for you.

43:07.905 --> 43:10.105
Your Highness
will not be seen as colluding with them.

43:10.185 --> 43:11.305
And with this achievement,

43:11.385 --> 43:13.065
His Majesty will surely praise you.

43:14.025 --> 43:16.385
By right, you should reward us.

43:16.465 --> 43:19.265
I'm here to punish you.

43:19.345 --> 43:21.065
Why must I reward you?

43:21.145 --> 43:22.465
Didn't I explain?

43:22.545 --> 43:25.905
Our achievement offsets the crime.
It's even now.

43:26.545 --> 43:27.465
All right now.

43:28.065 --> 43:29.185
We'll be leaving now.

43:29.825 --> 43:30.665
No need to see us off.

43:32.705 --> 43:33.745
Halt.

43:36.825 --> 43:38.145
To reward you two,

43:38.225 --> 43:39.345
I have set up a banquet.

43:39.425 --> 43:40.865
Won't you do me the honor?

43:47.585 --> 43:49.905
You did what
you did to save innocent lives.

43:49.985 --> 43:51.505
On behalf of Southern Chu citizens,

43:51.585 --> 43:52.425
allow me to thank you.

43:56.985 --> 43:58.145
Thank you, Your Highness.

44:03.065 --> 44:04.025
I'll dig in then.

44:10.345 --> 44:11.945
Miss Ling, you are still injured.

44:12.025 --> 44:13.825
You shouldn't ingest chilled food.

44:18.305 --> 44:20.905
Pear soup is rejuvenating.
You should drink more.

44:24.865 --> 44:26.425
-Here.
-Thank you.

44:29.425 --> 44:31.465
Mr. Bai, you seem to care a lot

44:31.545 --> 44:32.705
about this woman.

44:36.625 --> 44:38.145
Forgive me.

44:38.225 --> 44:39.825
How may I address you, miss?

44:42.065 --> 44:43.105
I'm…

44:43.185 --> 44:45.265
Oh. He's a prince.

44:45.345 --> 44:46.785
Surely, he knows
about the marital arrangement.

44:46.865 --> 44:48.425
I should not cause any unwanted trouble.

44:48.505 --> 44:50.065
I'm Zhong Lin, Vice Sect Leader
of Fenglai Pavilion.

44:52.625 --> 44:54.785
Oh, Miss Zhong.

44:56.065 --> 44:57.745
She must be Ling Cangcang.

44:58.345 --> 45:00.185
Huan always moves with a goal in mind.

45:00.265 --> 45:02.425
So he is after her.
